TIP:  (For the untransposed) the intro notes are:  (g) = top string/3rd fret, (f#) = top string/2nd fret, and (e) = open top string, which are the same as "...all my blue moon nights."  Or if you'd rather play them in the middle register:  (g) = open 3rd string, (f#) = 4th string/4th fret, and (e) = 4th string/2nd fret.  In either case cover the final (d) by strumming (D).

TIP:  Real important to get the strumming cadence down as it drives the whole song.
    

